NOTEX[en]="Breaks in data series and outstanding values#- Obligatory registration of mopeds since May 2017 (possible already since April 2017).#- Due to the coronavirus (COVID-19) epidemic, the registration of vehicles in Slovenia was not possible between 17 March "
"2020 and 19 April 2020.#- Since June 2022, the amendment to the Drivers Act simplifies the conditions for obtaining a driver's license for mopeds and motorcycles up to 125 cubic centimetres.#For detailed information about breaks in the data series see Me"
"thodological explanations.#Where not specifically stated, it is powered by the internal combustion engine.";
NOTE[en]="Linked content:#- <A class=seznam HREF= https://www.stat.si/statweb/File/DocSysFile/8020 target=_blank>Methodological explanations</A>";
NOTE[en]("COHESION AND STATISTICAL REGION")="Data are territorially classsified according to The Classification of Territorial Units for Statistics – NUTS, (<A class='seznam' HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/en/Methods/Classifications TARGET=_blank>description and explanations</A>).#Level NUTS 2: D"
"ata on changes of individual cohesion regions are available at the <A class=seznam HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/File/DocSysFile/9429/ TARGET=_blank>link</A>.#Level NUTS 3: Data on changes of individual statistical regions are available at the <A clas"
"s=seznam HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/File/DocSysFile/9431/ TARGET=_blank>link</A>.";
